        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion SE-A2, Tubular Stainless Steel Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFusion Hardware's Tubular SE-A2 Stainless Steel Leverset has a simple contemporary design that features a sleek concealed screw assembly. It is available in both brushed and polished stainless steel finishes that only add to the modern look of this lever and rose set. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion SE-A2 Simple Stainless Steel Lever With Contemporary Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Stainless Steel Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Simple SE-A2 Stainless Steel Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Simple Stainless Steel Leverset, Fusion SE-A2",
                "description": "Tubular Stainless Steel Leverset Fusion SE-A2 - Fusion Hardware's Tubular Stainless Steel Leverset has a simple contemporary design that features a sleek concealed screw assembly. It is available in both Brushed and Polished Stainless Steel finishes that only add to the modern look of this lever and rose set. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
